    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The plugin is useful for the superadmin of a multisite installations. It adds sortable columns to the Sites admin table in Network administration page.</p>\n<p>The new columns are the following fields of the database table &#8216;wp_blogs&#8217;:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>blog_id</li>\n<li>public</li>\n<li>archived</li>\n<li>mature</li>\n<li>spam</li>\n<li>deleted</li>\n<li>site_id</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The superadmin can hide the unwanted Columns via the Screen Option panel.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatibility with WordPress 7.0.</li>\n<li>Minor fixes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release version.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "For Multisite only. The plugin adds sortable columns to the network Sites admin table.",
    "description": "<p>The plugin is useful for the superadmin of a multisite installations. It adds sortable columns to the Sites admin table in Network administration page.</p>\n<p>The new columns are the following fields of the database table &#8216;wp_blogs&#8217;:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>blog_id</li>\n<li>public</li>\n<li>archived</li>\n<li>mature</li>\n<li>spam</li>\n<li>deleted</li>\n<li>site_id</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The superadmin can hide the unwanted Columns via the Screen Option panel.</p>\n",
